{"version":1,"content":"<p>MIRROR成員邱士縉（Stanley，大表哥）和李炘頤（Alina）昨天（25日）在峇里舉行婚禮，MIRROR部分隊友包括姜濤﹑呂爵安﹑李駿傑﹑邱傲然﹑盧瀚霆和柳應廷都有親身到賀，一對新人還親手讚感謝卡，向到來賓客致謝。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T12:00:31.215653+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T11:43:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T00:58:11.051385+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T11:58:05.264790+00:00","content_hash":"d1d48cc1fcb91563e90f8a2852fa2b92c49b2a87e0ae11f7b87a16d7a81a95a4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}